Description: Wild OS formula bar
 Tables' formula bar as on the design boards: the name box, then the
 function wizard and AutoSum (no separator, no = button, no menu on the
 sum), then the formula in a rounded field a shade into the ink, with a
 1 px edge that turns to the accent colour while the formula is edited.
 The button that expands the field to several lines is not shown (the
 bar's lower edge still drags it taller, and an expanded field still has
 its button to collapse). LibreOffice Online is unchanged.
Author: Wild OS Developers <dev@wildos.io>
Forwarded: not-needed

